Bash an enemy in melee range with your shield (twice for talent level 5 or more), doing [144%, 163%, 177%, 189%, 200% (TL1-5)] damage and knocking them back [2, 2, 3, 3, 3 (TL1-5)] squares. You may then follow with a deadly short-range sling attack, dealing [217%, 244%, 266%, 284%, 300% (TL1-5)] damage. The shield bash will use Dexterity instead of Strength for the shield's bonus damage.
